Release artifacts are not original work of this repository
-----------------------------------------------------------
The files published under Releases are reassembled from an upstream installer
of DeepSeek Harness 0.2.1-alpha.1 (fix11) whose original payload targets
win-x64. This repository replaces the x64 shell and x64 native payload with
arm64 counterparts obtained from the respective upstream projects, repacks
`app.asar`, and rebuilds the installer. No upstream source code is included
here.

